{"c":[{"name":"20261021T191821Z-1972e75cf1dd3323","text":"Operator 2026-10-21: silent HNSW fold is doctor-only, plus an index-coverage check. No repair on reconnect. The fix command is doctor fix hnsw-rebuild.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261021T193821Z-1b68223f17357c6b","text":"Operator 2026-10-21: about five installs, nightly embed, rollout is days. Tune for a finished embed. A power loss may need the troubleshooting page. It must not empty the warehouse. HNSW drops only around inserts.","type":"note"}]}
